 photo: Large black-framed insulated patio cover with ceiling fans over cream wicker sofas surrounded by palms\"><img src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/insulated-patio-cover-black-frame-ceiling-fans-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Large black-framed insulated patio cover with ceiling fans over cream wicker sofas surrounded by palms\" width=\"1024\" height=\"667\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-large-span-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Large white louvered roof with partly open blades over a travertine patio with wicker lounge furniture\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-large-span-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Large white louvered roof with partly open blades over a travertine patio with wicker lounge furniture\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-open-blades-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White louvered roof with blades open against a blue sky over a travertine patio with wicker furniture\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-open-blades-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"White louvered roof with blades open against a blue sky over a travertine patio with wicker furniture\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/pergolas/covered-pergola-brown-paver-patio-pool-palms-florida-02.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Brown covered pergola with rafter tails over a paver patio with turquoise seating, grill and freeform pool\"><img src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/covered-pergola-brown-paver-patio-pool-palms-florida-02.webp\" alt=\"Brown covered pergola with rafter tails over a paver patio with turquoise seating, grill and freeform pool\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/banco/pergolas/wood-pergola-outdoor-kitchen-putting-green-lake-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"Dark wood pergola over an outdoor kitchen bar and lounge with TV screen beside a putting green.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/banco/pergolas/freestanding-patio-cover-bronze-pool-deck-travertine-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"Freestanding bronze insulated pergola with slatted privacy screen and wicker seating beside a curved pool\"}]</script></section><div><section class=\"services\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div><div data-w-id=\"983862a7-3688-6e3b-afeb-1962d292774b\" class=\"header-subservices\"><div class=\"heading-deco\">What do we do!</div><h2 class=\"blue\">Custom Outdoor Furniture Design, Installation &amp; Renovation</h2><p>We curate and install premium outdoor furniture in teak, aluminum, and wicker for North and South Florida homes and estates.</p></div></div><div class=\"block-page-service\"><div class=\"svc-detalle\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--derecha\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/residentials/premium-outdoor-furniture-for-north-south-florida-homes/outdoor-furniture-florida.avif\" alt=\"Wicker seating set on a pool deck under a wood pergola\" width=\"1950\" height=\"1219\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Custom Layouts, Modular Seating</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">We size dining sets, sectionals, and chaises to the lanai, pool deck, or terrace they will sit on, so walkways, door swings, and screen enclosure posts stay clear. Modular sections rearrange for a family dinner or a twenty-person party, so one set covers both.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/custom-patio-furniture-design/custom-patio-furniture-design.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Custom Patio Furniture Design</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">South Florida designers create custom outdoor furniture plans tailored to homeowners’ style and space</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/modular-seating-design-installation/modular-seating-design-installation.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Modular Seating Design &amp; Installation</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Installers create modular seating arrangements to maximize patio space and flexibility</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--izquierda\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/images/furniture-7/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Outdoor sectional arranged around a fire pit table\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Teak, Hardwood &amp; Aluminum</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">Teak and dense tropical hardwoods hold up to Florida humidity and weather down to a gray patina you can leave alone or re-oil. Powder-coated aluminum stays light enough to carry indoors and resists salt-air corrosion. We use stainless hardware on both, since plated fasteners corrode first.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/teak-hardwood-furniture-installation/teak-hardwood-furniture-installation.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Teak &amp; Hardwood Furniture Installation</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Installers assemble and install durable teak and hardwood furniture sets for residential patios.</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/aluminum-furniture-assembly-services/aluminum-furniture-assembly-services.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Aluminum Furniture Assembly Services</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Contractors install lightweight, rust‑resistant aluminum furniture for long‑lasting outdoor use.</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--derecha\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/images/furniture-4/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Wicker sofa set on a terrace overlooking the ocean\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Wicker Lounges, Sustainable Sourcing</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">All-weather resin wicker woven over aluminum frames keeps its color under Florida UV instead of turning brittle like natural rattan. We cover cushions in solution-dyed acrylic that sheds an afternoon downpour and resists mildew, and we source FSC-certified teak and recycled-content frames on request.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/wicker-lounge-set-installation/wicker-lounge-set-installation.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Wicker Lounge Set Installation</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Builders set up weather‑proof wicker lounges and seating areas that blend comfort and style</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/sustainable-outdoor-furniture-solutions/sustainable-outdoor-furniture-solutions.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Sustainable Outdoor Furniture Solutions</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Designers recommend eco‑friendly materials and accessories for environmentally conscious homeowners</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--izquierda\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/images/furniture-2/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"Pair of loungers beside an infinity pool\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Refinishing, Delivery &amp; Placement</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">Good frames outlast their finish, so we sand and re-oil teak, re-strap aluminum, and rebuild cushions rather than replace a set that still fits. Our crews deliver, assemble, and place each piece, keep egress paths clear, and leave lightweight items easy to stow when a storm watch goes up.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/outdoor-furniture-renovation-services/outdoor-furniture-renovation-services.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Outdoor Furniture Renovation Services</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Contractors refurbish existing furniture with durable finishes and cushions for continued use.</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/professional-furniture-installation-staging/professional-furniture-installation-staging.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Professional Furniture Installation &amp; Staging</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">South Florida installers professionally place and secure outdoor furniture for a polished look.</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"process-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dce80844-cc8a-923f-8fa1-aa91c1419f9a\" class=\"process-header\"><h2>Our Outdoor Furniture Process</h2><p data-w-id=\"dce80844-cc8a-923f-8fa1-aa91c1419f9d\">Our team guides Florida homeowners in selecting and installing premium outdoor furniture for lasting comfort and beauty on patios and pool areas.</p></div><div class=\"process-steps-nav\"><div class=\"process-step-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-step-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">1</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">2</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">3</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">4</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"line-bar\"></div></div><div class=\"process-content-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-content-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Your outdoor furniture project begins with expert consultation to select premium, weather-resistant furniture engineered for Florida's heat, UV exposure, and coastal conditions.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/outdoor-furniture-step-1/outdoor-furniture-step-1.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Planning &amp; Selection</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Contract execution, project documentation, and selection of outdoor furniture to match the design and client preferences.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Your outdoor furniture order is placed and confirmed directly with the supplier. Lead times and delivery specs are locked in to keep your Florida outdoor living project on schedule.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/outdoor-furniture-step-2/outdoor-furniture-step-2.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Order Placement</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Furniture is ordered and confirmed with supplier, including lead times and specifications.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Furniture delivery is coordinated to align with your project completion. Our team professionally places and arranges every piece — so your Florida outdoor space looks perfect from day one.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/outdoor-furniture-step-3/outdoor-furniture-step-3.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Delivery Scheduling</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Coordinate and schedule delivery to align with project completion and site readiness. Furniture is delivered, placed, and arranged in the designated areas.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Final positioning and adjustments ensure optimal comfort, flow, and aesthetic balance. Your outdoor living space in Florida is fully complete and ready for relaxing and entertaining.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/outdoor-furniture-step-4/outdoor-furniture-step-4.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Final Touches &amp; Enjoyment</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Final adjustments completed and space is ready for use and enjoyment.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-embed w-script\"><script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n\n  const AUTOPLAY_DELAY = 5000;\n\n  const COLOR_ACTIVE   = '#001C63';\n  const COLOR_INACTIVE = '#D99933';\n\n  const dots  = document.querySelectorAll('.process-step-item');\n  const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.process-content-item');\n\n  if (!dots.length || !steps.length) return;\n\n  let currentStep = 0;\n  let autoTimer   = null;\n  let isAnimating = false;\n\n  function goToStep(index) {\n    if (isAnimating) return;\n    isAnimating = true;\n\n    const prevStep = currentStep;\n    currentStep = index;\n\n    // ── 1. Actualizar DOTS (nav) ──────────────────────────\n    dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {\n      const circle = dot.querySelector('.tab-circle, [class*=\"tab-circle\"], [class*=\"Tab-Circle\"]');\n      const number = dot.querySelector('[class*=\"step-number\"], [class*=\"Step-Number\"]'); // ✅ DENTRO de goToStep\n\n      if (!circle) return;\n\n      if (i === currentStep) {\n        circle.style.background = COLOR_ACTIVE;\n        circle.style.transform  = 'scale(1.15)';\n        circle.style.boxShadow  = '0 4px 16px rgba(0,28,99,0.25)';\n        circle.style.transition = 'all 0.35s ease';\n        if (number) number.style.color = '#FFFFFF'; // ✅ Blanco activo\n      } else {\n        circle.style.background = COLOR_INACTIVE;\n        circle.style.transform  = 'scale(1)';\n        circle.style.boxShadow  = 'none';\n        circle.style.transition = 'all 0.35s ease';\n        if (number) number.style.color = '#001C63'; // ✅ Navy inactivo\n      }\n    });\n\n    // ── 2. Animar salida del paso anterior ────────────────\n    if (steps[prevStep] && prevStep !== currentStep) {\n      const outEl = steps[prevStep];\n      outEl.style.transition = 'opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease';\n      outEl.style.opacity    = '0';\n      outEl.style.transform  = 'translateY(-10px)';\n\n      setTimeout(function () {\n        outEl.style.display = 'none';\n        showCurrentStep();\n      }, 300);\n    } else {\n      showCurrentStep();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function showCurrentStep() {\n    steps.forEach(function (s) {\n      s.style.display = 'none';\n      s.style.opacity = '0';\n    });\n\n    const activeEl = steps[currentStep];\n    if (!activeEl) { isAnimating = false; return; }\n\n    activeEl.style.display   = 'flex';\n    activeEl.style.transform = 'translateY(12px)';\n    activeEl.style.opacity   = '0';\n\n    void activeEl.offsetWidth;\n\n    activeEl.style.transition = 'opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease';\n    activeEl.style.opacity    = '1';\n    activeEl.style.transform  = 'translateY(0)';\n\n    setTimeout(function () { isAnimating = false; }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function startAutoplay() {\n    stopAutoplay();\n    autoTimer = setInterval(function () {\n      const next = (currentStep + 1) % dots.length;\n      goToStep(next);\n    }, AUTOPLAY_DELAY);\n  }\n\n  function stopAutoplay() {\n    if (autoTimer) { clearInterval(autoTimer); autoTimer = null; }\n  }\n\n  dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {\n    dot.style.cursor = 'pointer';\n    dot.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      if (i === currentStep) return;\n      stopAutoplay();\n      goToStep(i);\n      startAutoplay();\n    });\n  });\n\n  const section = document.querySelector('.process-section');\n  if (section) {\n    section.addEventListener('mouseenter', stopAutoplay);\n    section.addEventListener('mouseleave', startAutoplay);\n  }\n\n  goToStep(0);\n  startAutoplay();\n\n});\n</script></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design3-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design3.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"255\"></section>";
const T6 = "<section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc3\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>Outdoor Furniture FAQs</h2><div>Have questions about premium outdoor furniture in Florida? Our team helps North and South Florida homeowners select and install durable pieces.</div></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">What outdoor materials last longest in Florida climates?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Teak, powder-coated aluminum, and high-density polyethylene wicker all resist humidity, salt air, and UV exposure — making them ideal for Florida's coastal and inland climates. These materials maintain structural integrity and appearance without the warping, rust, or fading common with lower-grade outdoor materials.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How do I care for teak outdoor furniture in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Teak outdoor furniture requires minimal care in Florida climates, as its natural oils protect against rot, pest damage, and warping even in direct sun and coastal humidity. Occasional cleaning and optional oiling every one to two years maintains the wood's rich appearance and extends the life of your investment significantly.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Is HDPE wicker furniture durable in Florida's climate?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. High-density polyethylene wicker is engineered to resist UV fading, moisture absorption, cracking, and mold growth — making it one of the most durable outdoor furniture materials for Florida's humid, sun-intense climate. HDPE wicker maintains its color and structural integrity for many years with only occasional cleaning required.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do outdoor cushions resist Florida sun and humidity?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Premium outdoor cushions use solution-dyed acrylic fabrics engineered for UV fading, mildew, and moisture resistance. These quick-dry materials are designed for Florida's intense sun and frequent rain. Properly maintained cushions retain their color and shape across multiple years of year-round outdoor use in South Florida.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can you help design the layout of my outdoor space?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Our design team provides personalized layout guidance to arrange outdoor furniture for optimal traffic flow and visual proportion on your Florida patio or pool deck. From selecting the right scale of pieces to coordinating finishes with your home's exterior, every installation reflects the aesthetic of a well-designed outdoor space.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section><section class=\"testimonial-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"74852c7c-aeb3-35a7-5cf1-44f4ce6ecae5\" class=\"header-reviews\"><div class=\"label\">TESTIMONIALS</div><h2 class=\"white\">What Our Clients Say About Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><p>Read testimonials from Florida homeowners who value the comfort and lasting durability of premium outdoor furniture selected and installed by our team.</p></div>";
